Flicktail — third-party notices
===============================

This file covers the fonts, and the art and audio that were generated with AI
tools rather than written as code in this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Music, ambience and sound effects — assets/audio/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  music_desert.mp3   music_golden.mp3   music_lagoon.mp3   music_last.mp3
  music_latin.mp3    music_morning.mp3  music_neon.mp3     music_riviera.mp3
  amb_beach_day.mp3  amb_beach_sunset.mp3  amb_night.mp3

  sfx/*.mp3          (the sound-effect one-shots)

All of these were generated locally with Stable Audio 3
(stabilityai/stable-audio-3-medium-base): the sound effects are sampled
one-shots, not synthesis. Nothing was uploaded and no third-party service was
used to make them. The game's WebAudio code (src/audio.js) synthesizes only the
button tap and the wind gust, plus a stand-in voice for any one-shot that has
not loaded.

